House with great housing and investment potential.

We present this excellent villa located in the parish of Terra-Chã, in the municipality of Angra do Heroísmo, in a quiet, safe and welcoming area of Terceira Island, just five minutes from the city of Angra do Heroísmo, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.

The property stands out for its generous areas, versatility and enormous potential, and can be used as a home, a two-family home, rental investment or tourist project, including the possibility of operating local accommodation, subject to compliance with the applicable legal requirements.

Ground floor

The ground floor consists of:

Three bedrooms;

Two rooms;

A kitchen;

Two bathrooms;

Balcony;

Esplanade;

Privileged mountain view.

Ground floor

The lower floor has an independent and functional configuration, consisting of:

Two bedrooms;

One room;

A kitchen;

A bathroom;

Engine room

This configuration allows, for example, to inhabit the ground floor and monetise the ground floor through renting, creating an additional source of income and making this property particularly interesting for investors.

Exterior and complementary areas

The villa also has:

Garage with capacity for two cars;

Backyard;

Esplanade;

Attachments for storage;

Outdoor spaces with potential for leisure and socialising.

Built in reinforced concrete, the villa has a robust and solid construction. According to the information provided, it does not have termite problems.

A quiet location with excellent potential:

The property is located in one of the quietest areas of the municipality, known for its peaceful atmosphere and the friendliness of the local population. It also has public transport and is close to the Scientific Research Centre of Terceira Island, which reinforces the interest of the location for both housing and rent.

The proximity of Angra do Heroísmo allows you to enjoy all the services, commerce, restaurants, culture and heritage of the city, while maintaining the tranquillity of living in a residential area.

An opportunity to live or invest:

Due to its size, interior distribution, outdoor spaces and the possibility of independent use of the two floors, this villa represents an excellent opportunity for those looking for a spacious home on Terceira Island or a property with strong potential for profitability.

Whether for a family residence, long-term rental, use of the ground floor as a detached unit or for a tourist project, this is a property that offers versatility, location and potential for appreciation.

